WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,070
Let’s get off to a good start

2
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:10,460
Ye, the sheep are also short of me

3
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,190
You'll be unlucky if you run into me

4
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:21,980
Stop bragging

5
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:36,180
If you're short of chickens, it's worth replacing you with a sheep

6
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:43,340
Find your own work, it's over

7
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:54,390
It’s enough to try the meat tube

8
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:56,390
Mine is tenderer than his

9
00:00:56,390 --> 00:01:10,640
Both of them have been fed

10
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,770
Someone has to take care of the soup, right?

11
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:13,770
After Brother Yan

12
00:01:13,770 --> 00:01:16,770
Standing and watching, I can watch my sister with a full stomach

13
00:01:16,770 --> 00:01:18,770
I've been holding up my chopsticks for a long time.

14
00:01:18,770 --> 00:01:21,280
Brother, the aftertaste is fragrant

15
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:25,260
Remember today's rules

16
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:31,380
Those who work eat a big bowl

17
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:32,380
Lazy people can only look at the bark of trees
